---
module: alerts
func_id: silence-on-read
---

***conformance tests***

# silent-patient-red
Right after the service starts, `GET /patients` shows `pat-05` with `status` `RED` and a `latestAssessment` with one `R5` reason and no `checkInId`.

# no-duplicate-silence
After `GET /patients` twice in a row, `GET /assessments?patientId=pat-05` has exactly one :Assessment: with an `R5` reason and `status` `RED`.
